### ----- USERS -----
### Get all users (requires login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### Get one user by id (requires login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/6528a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d5

### Update my user profile (requires login/owner)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/6528a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com"
}

### Delete user (requires owner/admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/6528a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d5

### ----- AUTH -----
### Start GitHub OAuth login
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/github

### Authentication status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/status

### Logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout